@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain

title EditCommand: replace Tutorial 1 with Tutorial 2
participant "command:EditCommand" as Command LOGIC_COLOR
participant "pending:ModelManager" as Model MODEL_COLOR
[-> Command : execute(pending)
activate Command
Command -> Command : findStudent(pending)
Command -> Model : getAddressBook().getPersonList()
Model --> Command : all students
Command -> Command : createEditedPerson(student, descriptor)
note over Command
Remove Tutorial 1, then add Tutorial 2.
Retain Student ID, attendance,
and all unspecified fields.
Invalid changes throw CommandException.
end note
Command -> Model : setPerson(student, editedStudent)
Command -> Model : updateFilteredPersonList(PREDICATE_SHOW_ALL_PERSONS)
[<-- Command : result
deactivate Command
@enduml
